      "synthesis": {
        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Under dry oxygen-free argon/N2 (Schlenk or glovebox), a toluene solution (20 mL) of (tBuO)3SiOH (5.95 g, 22.5 mmol) was added to a toluene solution (50 mL) of (C5Me5)2Sm(thf)2 (8.46 g, 15 mmol) at room temperature with stirring. The color changed immediately from purple to green. After stirring 2 h, solvent was removed under reduced pressure. The residue was washed with hexane and dried to give 1 as a green powder. Single crystals of 1 (1·0.5C6H6) were grown from concentrated hot toluene.",
